---
/** Short preview of the next step: Threatless inside Outlook / Gmail. Visual only. */
---

<section class="kq-addin" aria-labelledby="addin-title" style="margin-top: var(--kq-section)">
  <div style="display:grid; gap:0.75rem">
    <span class="kq-mode__tag">Coming next</span>
    <h2 id="addin-title" class="kq-h2">Right inside your inbox</h2>
    <p class="kq-muted">
      Threatless for Outlook and Gmail: report a strange e-mail with one tap – it goes straight to your coordinator. The team
      alert level shows next to every message.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="kq-addin__window" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="kq-addin__mail">
      <strong>accounts@city-school-berlin.co</strong>
      <span class="kq-muted">OVERDUE: Workshop invoice #4471</span>
      <span class="kq-addin__mail-line" style="width:92%; margin-top:0.5rem"></span>
      <span class="kq-addin__mail-line" style="width:78%"></span>
      <span class="kq-addin__mail-line" style="width:85%"></span>
      <span class="kq-addin__mail-line" style="width:40%"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="kq-addin__pane">
      <strong style="font-size:0.95rem">Threat<span style="color:var(--kq-pink)">less</span></strong>
      <span class="kq-addin__level"><span class="kq-dot" data-level="yellow" style="background:var(--kq-amber-dot)"></span>Yellow – be careful</span>
      <span class="kq-muted">2 warning signs: time pressure, new bank account</span>
      <span class="kq-addin__report">Report this e-mail</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
